rukkuvel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prasanthkarukkuvel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prasanthkarukkuvel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prasanthkarukkuvel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prasanthkarukkuvel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prasanthkarukkuvel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T01:01:51Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T01:01:51Z","body":"The instructions are not picked in the Agent Mode when  the model decides to create a new language file or trying to update the available file on it own unless we specifically add the files or the instructions manually. Any one got a grip on this? Like asking a model to look f or the instructions before creating a certain file?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3322028200/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3323152178","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770#issuecomment-3323152178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770","id":3323152178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7GE0cy","user":{"login":"aeschli","id":6461412,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjE0MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6461412?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli","html_url":"https://github.com/aeschli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-09-23T09:34:04Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T09:34:04Z","body":"That's already what we do. The agent prompt gets a list of all instructions files along with their descriptions and applyTo patterns and is asked to load these if needed, in particular when creating new files.\nSome models follow this better than others. \nI recommend to use the descriptions to clarify what the instructions are for.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3323152178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3491141961","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770#issuecomment-3491141961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770","id":3491141961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7QFplJ","user":{"login":"TheColorRed","id":1571806,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzE4MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1571806?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed","html_url":"https://github.com/TheColorRed","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheColorRed/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T13:13:36Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T13:15:30Z","body":"Even when instructions are included in the request, the agent doesn't seem to listen. For example I tell it not to use the `any` type in my typescript files, However, for me it includes my \"typescript\" instructions file.\n\n<img width=\"646\" height=\"291\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/425f7bb5-25e1-4ed4-b9e4-353e7ba6ce3e\" />\n\nIn that file it says \"Never use `any`\" **typescript.instructions.md**:\n\n<img width=\"226\" height=\"30\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87c756cf-535f-4d54-8097-d45591093b0b\" />\n\nThe agent the proceeds to build a file using the `any` type. It then only fixes the file because of eslint errors that I have setup.\n\n---\n\nHere is another one (from the same prompt as above) **react.instructions.md:**\n\n<img width=\"848\" height=\"59\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f49de056-db04-4e5b-a994-c00a7ca4200c\" />\n\nand here are the imports it decided to generate:\n\n<img width=\"738\" height=\"120\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0cf5635-7f4a-4405-9469-60fd2dc33d53\" />\n\nThe only thing I can think of is maybe I wasn't broad enough in the example, and maybe it assumes only for those imports (`useEffect` and `useState`)?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3491141961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3592738806","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770#issuecomment-3592738806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770","id":3592738806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7WJNf2","user":{"login":"tlaukkanen","id":65841,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65841?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen","html_url":"https://github.com/tlaukkanen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlaukkanen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-30T15:58:11Z","updated_at":"2025-11-30T15:58:11Z","body":"Thanks for mentioning the power of `description` as the documentation only highlights the `applyTo` part. There was a big difference when we had only the `applyTo` like:\n```markdown\n---\napplyTo: \"**/*.ts,**/*.tsx,**/*.css\"\n---\n...\n```\ncompared to having also `description` and `name`:\n```\n---\nname: Frontend Code Style Guidelines\ndescription: Guidelines for maintaining consistent code style in the frontend codebase.\napplyTo: \"**/*.ts,**/*.tsx,**/*.css\"\n---\n...\n```\nIt hardly never included the instructions with plain _applyTo_ part but now includes it well with _description_ and _name_ when adding .tsx files to the context for example.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3592738806/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3634383655","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770#issuecomment-3634383655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770","id":3634383655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7YoEsn","user":{"login":"aeschli","id":6461412,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjE0MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6461412?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli","html_url":"https://github.com/aeschli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-12-09T21:34:53Z","updated_at":"2025-12-09T21:35:24Z","body":"If this is still an issue please create a new issue in https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues with detailed steps to reproduce.\nTo see what ended up in a request use the request log: https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/wiki/Copilot-Issues#language-model-requests-and-responses\nTo see which instruction files were found by VS Code run `Chat: Configure Instructions...` or ask Copilot in agent mode: 'what instruction files are available'\nTo debug the 'apply to' pattern use https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/wiki/Copilot-Issues#custom-instructions-logs\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3634383655/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3655053675","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770#issuecomment-3655053675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770","id":3655053675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7Z27Fr","user":{"login":"LennertSchepers","id":6145889,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNDU4ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6145889?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers","html_url":"https://github.com/LennertSchepers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LennertSchepers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-15T11:08:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T11:08:26Z","body":"Hi @aeschli,\n\nI followed the instructions at\nhttps://github.com/microsoft/vscode/wiki/Copilot-Issues#custom-instructions-logs\n\nusing a custom instructions file **without a header**, and got the following logs:\n\n```\n2025-12-15 11:40:11.296 [trace] [Window] [InstructionsContextComputer] 1 instruction files available.\n2025-12-15 11:40:11.298 [trace] [Window] [InstructionsContextComputer] No 'applyTo' found: file:///path/to/my/.github/instructions/example.instructions.md\n```\n\n\nAfter adding an `applyTo` header to the instructions file:\n\n```\n---\napplyTo: \"**\"\n---\n```\n\nit started working as expected ✅\n\n```\n2025-12-15 11:50:52.918 [trace] [Window] [InstructionsContextComputer] 1 instruction files available.\n2025-12-15 11:50:52.918 [trace] [Window] [InstructionsContextComputer] Match for file:///path/to/my/.github/instructions/example.instructions.md with **\n```\n\nThis suggests that `applyTo` is required for the instructions file to be automatically recognized, even though the documentation currently states that the header is optional:\nhttps://code.visualstudio.com/docs/copilot/customization/custom-instructions#_header-optional\n\nIt might be helpful to clarify this in the docs (e.g. note that `applyTo` is required for automatic recognition, or remove the “optional” wording for the header). That would have saved me some time.\n\nHopefully this helps others who run into the same issue.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3655053675/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3661007350","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770#issuecomment-3661007350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12770","id":3661007350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7aNon2","user":{"login":"aeschli","id":6461412,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjE0MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6461412?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli","html_url":"https://github.com/aeschli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeschli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-12-16T15:03:29Z","updated_at":"2025-12-16T15:03:29Z","body":"This is issue https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/281878","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3661007350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}